script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"위성 경찰\n특수부대야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"우와!\n정말 그 사람들이구나!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"실제로 보는 건\n처음이야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"와, 저 사람들 정말\n멋지다아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"너희는 뭐가 그렇게\n신났어?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"저 사람들은 뭘 하는\n거야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"모른다고!?\n위성 경찰\n특수부대잖아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"그게 뭔지도\n모르겠는데."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	cmdE251
	"의\n\n직속 기관으로,"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"위저드와 리얼 웨이브의 보급과 함께\n늘어난 전파 관련 범죄를"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"처리하는\n\n조직이야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"가장 뛰어나고 경험\n많은 사람들만\n들어갈 수 있대."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"우와!\n정말 엘리트 집단 같아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"정말 멋지다..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Luna
	"남자애들은 저런 걸\n정말 좋아한다니까.\n난 전혀 관심 없지만."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"전혀 관심이 없다고?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우리의 훌륭한\n팀 리더가 되려면\n관심을 가져야지!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Zack
	"스바루 말이 맞아..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"위성 경찰의 역사를\n처음부터 끝까지\n들어 볼래?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
